  ('4', 4, false, 'Governance', '**2027 budget + payroll compensation approval by the board (written consent, no meeting needed).** Deferred 2026-09-30 by the President: each teacher''s monthly pay is under the bylaws'' $5,000 board threshold, so monthly payroll runs on the President''s written approval of the pay list (bylaws: over $2,000 = President''s written approval). The bylaws still require a budget adopted before each fiscal year (calendar year), and board-set compensation is what the 990 asks about, so the five roles and rates go into the 2027 budget vote: $12,000/month gross at target rates (Grade 1 $3,000, KG $2,500, Pre-K teacher $2,500, Pre-K assistant $1,000, Qur''an $3,000), about $13,380/month all-in, $133,800 over 10 school months; floor scenario $9,500 gross. Claude drafts the one-page consent in late November from the workbook; the four directors sign by e-mail; replies filed as the minute in `records/10_Policies & Governance`', 'Muneeb (President); Claude drafts', '2026-12-15', '2026-12-15', 'Not started', null, '[{"name": "2026-27 Teacher Payroll Budget (W-2 from 2026-10-01).xlsx", "path": "4/2026-27-Teacher-Payroll-Budget-W-2-from-2026-10-01-.xlsx", "size": 7798}]'::jsonb, now()),
