  ('8', 8, false, 'W-2 payroll · B. Registrations', '**City of Kent business license** applied via FileLocal 2026-09-24 (nonprofit fee exemption requested in the notes; 501(c)(3) letter to be provided if Kent asks). Waiting for Kent to issue the license / City Account Number. Then: save the license PDF to `records/01_Corporate & Legal/03. Registrations & Certificates`, record the FileLocal login in `docs/accounts.md`. State license needs nothing (UI, L&I, tax registration all Active) **Headcount:** application said 4 employees, actual is 5 (all five move to W-2 on 10-01); no fee effect (nonprofit exempt) — give the city 5 if they call, and restate at the Dec 31 renewal', 'Muneeb (President)', '2026-10-15', '2026-10-15', 'Waiting', null, '[]'::jsonb, now()),
