  ('12', 12, false, 'W-2 payroll · C. People', 'Per staff member (**five**): W-4, address, SSN and bank details via the **QuickBooks Workforce self-onboarding invite** (three invites go out once the President has connected the bank; two need emails first); I-9 Section 2 in person within 3 business days of Oct 1; class code, rate, sick-leave accrual already in QBO → copies to `records/16_Employees/<person>/02. Tax Forms`. **⚠ Pre-K assistant: $1,000/mo salary at ~104 h/mo is below WA minimum wage — make hourly or adjust before 10-30** **All five now in QBO with emails (2026-09-30).** Check after onboarding: the Pre-K assistant''s surname was entered wrongly (Mugaza) — she corrects it to Niazi in Workforce; verify on the Employees list. Qur''an teacher''s Job & pay, Time off and workers'' comp cards still to complete', 'Muneeb (Principal)', '2026-10-06', '2026-10-06', 'In progress', null, '[{"name": "i-9.pdf", "path": "12/i-9.pdf", "size": 920866}]'::jsonb, now()),
