  ('41', 41, false, 'Governance', '**WA Charities Program registration (RCW 19.09) — needed before the sponsorship and matching-gift drives go public (#88, #89).** Trigger: asking the general public for donations. The small-organisation exemption (under $50,000 raised a year **and no paid staff**) falls away now that payroll starts 2026-10-01. Claude checks the RCW 19.09.076 exemptions (religious organisations; whether a school asking beyond its own families qualifies) and prepares the answers (EIN, UBI, officers, fiscal year, purpose, financial summary); the President then registers online through CCFS → Charities ($60, renews yearly with the SOS report, see DEADLINES). Save the confirmation to `records/01_Corporate & Legal/03. Registrations & Certificates/`', 'Claude checks → Muneeb (President) registers', '2026-10-17', '2026-10-17', 'Not started', null, '[]'::jsonb, now()),
