  ('59', 59, false, 'Fundraiser', 'Fundraiser deck (`marketing/fundraiser-2026/deck/`): confirm the slide-10 expenses table numbers (3 teachers $2,700 gross, 17 students of which 12 paying, $3,100 expected tuition, $7,100 monthly gap) and set the event date on slide 1', 'Muneeb (President)', 'before fundraiser', null, 'In progress', null, '[{"name": "Falah-Academy-Fundraiser-2026.pptx", "path": "59/Falah-Academy-Fundraiser-2026.pptx", "size": 381157}, {"name": "Falah-Academy-Fundraiser-2026-overview.png", "path": "59/Falah-Academy-Fundraiser-2026-overview.png", "size": 1222001}]'::jsonb, now()),
  ('60', 60, false, 'Platform', 'Create the private backup repo and weekly encrypted pg_dump job per `website/supabase/OPS.md` §2; it does not exist yet (checked 2026-09-19), so the portal database has no backups', 'Muneeb (President)', '2026-10-31', '2026-10-31', 'Not started', null, '[]'::jsonb, now()),
  ('D49', 49, true, 'Hiring', '**All seven waiting teaching applicants answered (2026-10-04).** Three replies by the President in the evening (one local Arabic/Qur''an/Islamic Studies teacher → waiting list + references + volunteer offer; one PhD student abroad → declined, US residents only; one college student → volunteer invitation, availability requested); four by Claude on the President''s instruction with the same template (assistant-teacher inquiry of 09-19, two general inquiries of 08-26, and the 07-08 applicant whose phone call never connected → apology, waiting list, references, volunteer offer). The R-1 visa-sponsorship mass mail of 10-04 archived without reply. *Action needed* label cleared from all seven threads; they stay under *Hiring/Applications*. **Follow-ups live in #92 (volunteer program) — references and availability replies go to `records/16_Employees/00. Applicants & Waiting List/` when they arrive.** Was #82.', '', '', null, 'Done', '2026-10-04', '[]'::jsonb, now()),
  ('D48', 48, true, 'Security', '**GitGuardian exposed-password alert closed 2026-10-04.** The flagged secret was the two dev test logins'' passwords in a comment of `supabase/platform_seed_dev.sql` (commit 8c5db87 of 08-27). Prod had no such accounts (checked 10-04); the dev accounts existed and were reset/removed by the President. Claude stripped the passwords from the seed file in both repos (dev `ea0b4bc`, prod `a18854c`, pushed); a sweep of the prod repo found no other literal passwords. President marked the GitGuardian incident resolved. Was #81.', '', '', null, 'Done', '2026-10-04', '[]'::jsonb, now()),
  ('D47', 47, true, 'Admissions', '**Website admission enquiries (#83) — closed 2026-10-04 by the President; all four families kept in Admin → Admissions as applicant cards.** The two September form submissions (09-11 KG-age child, 09-22 Pre-K) were already in the portal as *under review* — the website form posts to the applicants table as well as e-mailing; the two 08-25 submissions (KG Auburn, Pre-K Renton) pre-dated that wiring and were entered by Claude from the e-mails. Admissions now shows 4 under review. *Action needed* label removed from the two Gmail threads; the family follow-up is the Principal''s call from the Admissions page.', '', '', null, 'Done', '2026-10-04', '[]'::jsonb, now()),
  ('D46', 46, true, 'Admin', '**School Gmail classified (2026-10-04):** 17 labels created (Compliance: L&I, ESD/SAW, SOS, Kent/DOR · Money: QuickBooks & Payroll, Zelle, Receipts · People: Families, Staff, Hiring, Red Comet · Tech, Security, Reports, Promotions · Action needed, Filed); ~200 threads of the last 45 days labelled, including all 18 Bank of America Zelle alerts. Action items became rows 81–86; #80 updated (federal e-pay/e-file active). October Zelle alerts (10-01, 10-02, 10-03) already carry "Zelle/Processed" from the hourly script. Older mail (before 2026-08-20, ~230 threads) not yet labelled', '', '', null, 'Done', '2026-10-04', '[]'::jsonb, now()),
  ('D45', 45, true, 'Portal', '**Staff role live and first helper onboarded (#76) — 2026-09-30:** phase 19 in prod; the Qur''an teacher''s login made staff on Settings → Staff & permissions (title Office Staff; Students/Teachers/Feedback/Health view, Admissions/Calendar/Announcements/Tasks edit, Academics view, Parents/Fees/Reports/Settings none). Name field added to the staff card (dev 2f04e6c, prod e94ec34). Open follow-ups: he signs out/in to see it; confirm his Admin → Teachers record carries the same Gmail; consider Academics edit so he can enter Qur''an progress in the portal', '', '', null, 'Done', '2026-09-30', '[]'::jsonb, now()),
  ('D44', 44, true, 'Bookkeeping', '**Zelle receipts posted automatically (#78) — live 2026-09-30:** phase 21 in prod; Apps Script "Zelle Sync Fees" on the school Gmail with SUPABASE_URL + SUPABASE_SERVICE_KEY, authorised, hourly trigger; first run "0 alerts seen" (alerts on or before 2026-09-30 are ignored because September was recorded by hand). October receipts post themselves when sender + amount are certain, otherwise wait on Admin → Fees "Zelle received — needs a match"; matching once teaches the sender. No parent alert on any payment', '', '', null, 'Done', '2026-09-30', '[]'::jsonb, now()),
